"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.3969},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.3908}],"script":{"source_path":"snFHs82WWBA.en-orig.vtt","words":208,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"You have probably seen this under any"},{"sec":1.8,"text":"video about India. Hindus burn their"},{"sec":3.9,"text":"wives alive. [music] Now, Sati was real."},{"sec":6,"text":"Some widows were talked out of it. Some"},{"sec":7.9,"text":"were burned on pyre. But, the number"},{"sec":9.5,"text":"behind it was a sophisticated propaganda"},{"sec":11.9,"text":"for fundraising. You see, in 1813, the"},{"sec":14.4,"text":"East India Company still kept"},{"sec":15.7,"text":"missionaries out of India. So, the"},{"sec":17.2,"text":"missionary lobby went straight to the"},{"sec":18.8,"text":"Parliament to force the door open. And"},{"sec":20.8,"text":"for that, they needed something"},{"sec":22.4,"text":"horrifying. So, William Wilberforce"},{"sec":24.4,"text":"stood up in the House of Commons and"},{"sec":26,"text":"said 10,000 widows were being burnt"},{"sec":28.2,"text":"alive in Bengal [music] every year."},{"sec":30.3,"text":"Nearly 900 petitions poured in."},{"sec":32.4,"text":"Parliament gave in and India was open to"},{"sec":34.6,"text":"the missions. And once the door was"},{"sec":36.3,"text":"open, the burning widow campaign became"},{"sec":38.3,"text":"their biggest fundraiser with engravings"},{"sec":40.5,"text":"of women on pyres in missionary"},{"sec":42.2,"text":"magazines and preachers touring Britain"},{"sec":44.6,"text":"and America telling Sati stories. But,"},{"sec":47,"text":"here's where it gets interesting. In"},{"sec":48.5,"text":"1815, the company started counting and"},{"sec":50.7,"text":"the Bengal Presidency, which looked like"},{"sec":52.6,"text":"this, came with fewer than 600 a year."},{"sec":54.9,"text":"And most of them widows over 40. So,"},{"sec":56.9,"text":"where did 10,000 come from? Well,"},{"sec":58.7,"text":"missionaries counted around Calcutta and"},{"sec":60.9,"text":"multiplied it across Bengal. And that"},{"sec":62.8,"text":"number got repeated until it became a"},{"sec":64.8,"text":"fact."}],"text":""}}